despite appearing in over 200 episodes  across 12 seasons of the big bang theory  there's a lot we don't know about penny  what's her maiden name why haven't we  ever seen her sister stick around to  learn the untold truth about penny  a common misconception about penny is  that her maiden name was never revealed  before she married leonard and took his  last name hofstadter however penny's  last name is actually revealed in the  season 2 episode the work song nano  cluster when penny gets a package  delivered as she's attempting to start  her own company on the packing label her  full name penny teller is visible you  definitely have to squint a little bit  but upon a close-up inspection of the  package it looks like it's addressed to  a teller what's most interesting about  this little tidbit of information is  that in 2019 at wondercon's panel for  the big bang theory when executive  producer steve molero was asked about  penny's last name he responded we got  nervous and superstitious about giving  her one perhaps he forgot about that  blink and you'll miss it detail from  season 2.  penny is a character who likes to talk  and her family is one of her favorite  subjects penny tells plenty of stories  about her colorful childhood and one  character who comes up frequently is her  sister lisa audiences know that lisa is  married has a son and that she  discovered penny's ex-boyfriend's blog  that detailed his love life with her my  friends at work found it my sister found  it judging by my email a number of  prisoners at the michigan state  penitentiary found it  despite the repeated references  audiences have never actually seen lisa  she didn't even make it to penny and  leonard's wedding which feels  exceptionally odd judging from the  number of times penny mentions lisa in  the series they seem close  and yet somehow the audience meets  penny's brother randall a meth dealer  who spends the majority of the show in  prison instead of her sister  the literal geniuses of the big bang  theory can be difficult for most  audience members to relate to so penny  serves as someone that viewers can  connect with however penny wasn't always  meant to be a part of the ensemble in  the original unaired pilot penny's role  on the show is filled by katie a  completely different character played by  amanda walsh according to comic book  katie was described as being quote a  street hardening tough-as-nails woman  with a vulnerable interior however all  the networks passed on this penniless  version of the show including its  eventual home cbs in a dvd special  feature actress kaylee cuoco revealed  that when she originally auditioned for  the big bang theory she didn't get the  part as katie was more of a brooding  character but once the show cut katie  and replaced her with penny cuoco was a  lock for the gig  kaylee cuoco told variety that she was  brought into a meeting and told that she  would be saying goodbye to penny sooner  than expected cuoco recalled that it was  the summer of 2018 and the cast had just  started shooting for season 12. she and  co-star johnny galecki assumed the  meeting was about the next season and  she remembers the two actors being  excited to continue with their  characters of course the conversation  went in a different direction jim  parsons who played sheldon said he was  ready to move on from the show then  creator chuck laurie announced if they  weren't all in it made sense to end the  series season 12 would be the final  season leaving cuoco in what she  described as a state of shock she noted  that there were many tears especially in  the final episode from the entire cast  and crew she also shared that her father  attended every taping that season you  know i just want the elevator to get  fixed  please  what a finale what a way to go out  the big bang theory had a total of 279  episodes across its 12-season run and  the entire main cast appeared in every  single one except for penny that is  that's because kaylee cuoco broke her  leg and had to miss some tapings  according to entertainment weekly cuoco  was horseback riding and was thrown off  her horse she initially laughed the  moment off but the horse was still  spooked by the incident and attempted to  jump over the actress landing on her leg  by accident cuoco was immediately taken  to the hospital where the doctors were  so concerned about infection that they  even brought up the option of amputation  luckily they ended up putting two metal  bars into her leg instead resulting in a  two-week hospital stay that mandated  penny be written out of two big bang  theory episodes once cuoco returned to  set the writers gave penny a bartending  job so that she could be shot from the  waist up hiding her injured leg behind  the counter check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite characters  are coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

